# Cloudflare Pages routing.
#
# The two named routes are pinned to their own prerendered files first, before
# the single-page fallback can swallow them — that fallback is what made every
# URL answer with the studio's head, so link previews for /jenny and /jane came
# out as the studio's card. Serving them as 200s, not redirects, keeps the URL
# the visitor sent intact.
#
# Everything else still falls through to the app, which routes it client-side.
/jenny  /jenny.html  200
/jane   /jane.html   200
/*      /index.html  200
